WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Twelve minutes is easy to measure.
A promise about what happens in your brain is something else.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A timer can tell you how long you listened.
It cannot certify deep meditation.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
An audio library may help you keep a routine.
That's a question of format and preference.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Claims about faster results or brainwave changes
need tests of the actual product.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Start free. Record what you notice.
Check the source and the limits.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Then decide whether an optional paid recording
fits your needs.
